Describes what characters see as they enter a room (talemate.rooms). The scene
history is that of the room (the prompt is about the room).

Variables:
  - room: the room entered (name, description)
  - arrivals / arrivals_text: who entered
  - present / present_text: who the arriving characters can see there
  - locations: where everyone else actually is, [{room, characters: [{name, unnoticed}]}]
  - narrator_coercion: the narrator coercion of the client generating this
-#}
{% set entered = "have" if arrivals|length > 1 else "has" -%}
{% set rendered_context_content -%}
## Quick Task Overview

Generate a short visual scene description for a new location or room a set amount of characters are entering into. Further clarification below.

{% include "content-classification.jinja2" %}
## {{ room.name }}
{% if room.description %}{{ room.description }}{% else %}No description, infer what {{ room.name }} looks like from the story.{% endif %}


